WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.315
Guide 6. Make and confirm an edit on the
laptop.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.775
Let's make our first change together.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:13.495
The starter has 30 cups, but our pretend
class has 28 students.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.835
We're going to change the cups quantity to
28. First I'll find the row label Reusable
cups

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:24.975
and find the Quantity column. The cell I
need is B2. I'll select it and check the
address box says B2.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:30.515
Now, with the cell selected, I'll type 28 to
replace 30. Then I'll press

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:35.675
Enter to confirm my change. Now the
selection might move to another cell.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:41.545
I still need to look back at B2 and check
its content. There it is: 28.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.200
I've changed the quantity, not the label
Reusable cups.

00:00:45.215 --> 00:00:52.135
Now you try. Change B2 to 28, confirm the
edit and check the cell again.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:58.800
When you're sure B2 shows 28, return to the
web page and select I checked B2. Continue.
The next cards will guide your other
changes.
